{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "when": {
        "source": {
          "kind": "stream",
          "event": "capabilities",
          "path": "connected"
        },
        "op": "eq",
        "value": false
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "section",
          "title": "Not connected to a machine",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "title": "This module works through a machine you are connected to",
              "lines": [
                "It reaches the rest of your network from there: SSH to find machines and install the agent, then HTTP to everything the agent runs.",
                "Connect to a machine on the same network as the fleet - the machine list is in the sidebar - and this page fills in by itself."
              ],
              "tone": "info"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "else": [
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "source": {
              "kind": "stream",
              "event": "capabilities",
              "path": "problem"
            },
            "op": "exists"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "section",
              "title": "This machine cannot reach the fleet",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "keyValue",
                  "source": {
                    "kind": "stream",
                    "event": "capabilities"
                  },
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "key": "sshVersion",
                      "label": "SSH client"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "problem",
                      "label": "Problem"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "What to do",
                  "lines": [
                    "Something the module cannot work without is missing on the machine you are connected to, so nothing has been read and no figure below would be real.",
                    "Module settings lists every tool it looks for. Install the missing ones there, or connect to a machine that already has them."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                },
                {
                  "type": "actions",
                  "actions": [
                    {
                      "label": "Check again",
                      "method": "sweepNow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "when": {
                "source": {
                  "kind": "stream",
                  "event": "capabilities",
                  "path": "warning"
                },
                "op": "exists"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "title": "Working, with something worth knowing",
                  "lines": [
                    "The fleet is being read, and one thing about the machine you are connected to makes it slower or less precise than it could be. Module settings names it."
                  ],
                  "tone": "warning"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "subnav",
              "items": [
                {
                  "id": "readiness",
                  "label": "Readiness",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "conditional",
                      "when": {
                        "source": {
                          "kind": "stream",
                          "event": "ui",
                          "path": "hintsOn"
                        },
                        "op": "eq",
                        "value": true
                      },
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What this checks",
                          "lines": [
                            "This module works entirely through the machine you are connected to. It runs ssh there to find your fleet, and curl there to talk to every agent - so what that machine has installed decides what the module can do.",
                            "Missing ssh, xargs, base64 or mktemp stops it completely. Missing curl stops everything after an agent is installed, which is why it is treated as fatal rather than as a warning."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "The machine you are connected to",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "keyValue",
                          "source": {
                            "kind": "stream",
                            "event": "capabilities"
                          },
                          "rows": [
                            {
                              "key": "connected",
                              "label": "Connected"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "sshVersion",
                              "label": "SSH client"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "ssh",
                              "label": "ssh"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "sshpass",
                              "label": "sshpass (password logins)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "curl",
                              "label": "curl (talking to agents)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "xargs",
                              "label": "xargs (parallelism)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "base64",
                              "label": "base64 (framing)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "mktemp",
                              "label": "mktemp (private temp dir)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "timeout",
                              "label": "timeout (per-machine limit)"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "nc",
                              "label": "nc"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "problem",
                              "label": "Blocking problem"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "warning",
                              "label": "Warning"
                            },
                            {
                              "key": "t",
                              "label": "Checked",
                              "format": "time"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "actions",
                          "actions": [
                            {
                              "label": "Look again",
                              "method": "sweepNow"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "targets",
                  "label": "Addresses",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "note",
                      "title": "Passwords here are stored in clear text",
                      "lines": [
                        "A module cannot encrypt anything - the app offers it no way to - and pretending otherwise would be worse than saying so. They sit in this module's settings file on the server.",
                        "Agent tokens are stored the same way, per machine. If that is not acceptable for your network, use SSH keys: set the login to \"key\" and give a path to a private key that lives on the machine you are connected to."
                      ],
                      "tone": "warning"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "section",
                      "title": "Addresses to watch",
                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "table",
